        "original_id": "45c59c2e-31cc-558a-a199-329df213abb7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bitter Jester, The Future of Food, Hollywood Outlaw: The Unmaking of a Bitter Jester\n- People: Richard Pryor, Richard Belzer, Deborah Koons Garcia\n- Topics: comedy world, genetically engineered foods, documentary films\n\nFacts:\n- Bitter Jester is a portrait of the comedy world and includes interviews with stars such as Richard Pryor and Richard Belzer.\n- The Future of Food is a 2004 American documentary film written and directed by Deborah Koons Garcia.\n- The Future of Food investigates unlabeled, patented, genetically engineered foods sold in United States grocery stores during the previous decade.\n- In 2004, the documentary Bitter Jester was buried amid scandal and was never seen again.\n- Hollywood Outlaw: The Unmaking of a Bitter Jester is the director’s cut of the controversial documentary Bitter Jester.",
